{"unit":{"id":"l1-u17","level":1,"order":17,"title":"Unit 17","wordIds":["w:回家","w:昨天","w:晚","w:书","w:五","w:先生","w:男","w:动","w:医院","w:重","w:真的","w:子"],"grammarIds":["g:zhende-confirm"],"sentenceIds":["s:l1:104","s:l1:105","s:l1:106","s:l1:107","s:l3:135","s:l3:219"]},"grammar":[{"id":"g:zhende-confirm","title":"真的 for \"really\" and \"true\"","pattern":"真的 + verb/adjective, or 是真的","explanation":"真的 (zhēnde) emphasizes that something is genuinely true, either as \"really\" before a verb (你真的想去吗?) or as \"true\" after 是 (这是真的). It's a common way to react to surprising news.","level":1,"sentenceIds":["s:l1:104","s:l1:105","s:l1:106","s:l1:107"],"unitId":"l1-u17"}],"sentences":[{"id":"s:l1:104","zh":"这是真的。","pinyin":"Zhè shì zhēnde.","en":"This is real.","wordIds":["w:这","w:是","w:真的"],"unitId":"l1-u17"},{"id":"s:l1:105","zh":"你真的想去吗？","pinyin":"Nǐ zhēnde xiǎng qù ma?","en":"Do you really want to go?","wordIds":["w:你","w:真的","w:想","w:去","w:吗"],"unitId":"l1-u17"},{"id":"s:l1:106","zh":"他真的来了。","pinyin":"Tā zhēnde lái le.","en":"He really came.","wordIds":["w:他","w:真的","w:来","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u17"},{"id":"s:l1:107","zh":"我真的没去。","pinyin":"Wǒ zhēnde méi qù.","en":"I really didn't go.","wordIds":["w:我","w:真的","w:没","w:去"],"unitId":"l1-u17"},{"id":"s:l3:135","zh":"太晚了，我们去不了了。","pinyin":"Tài wǎn le, wǒmen qù bu liǎo le.","en":"It's too late, we can't go anymore.","wordIds":["w:太","w:晚","w:了","w:我们","w:去","w:不","w:了","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u17"},{"id":"s:l3:219","zh":"他站住不动了。","pinyin":"Tā zhàn zhù bù dòng le.","en":"He stood still, not moving.","wordIds":["w:他","w:站","w:住","w:不","w:动","w:了"],"unitId":"l1-u17"}]}
